  <content>
  <section><para>Use graphing technology to solve the following problem.</para>
<para>Jacob charges $20 to mow a lawn in his neighborhood and $100 to paint a room.  </para>
<para>Which combination of jobs earns Jacob more than $1,000?</para>
 </section>
